    "description": "<p>You conjure a rushing wave to crash upon your enemies.</p><p>Choose a direction for a <strong>5-space-cone</strong>, starting at the edge of your space.</p><p>Every creature within the cone takes <strong>1 Damage</strong> and must make an opposed <strong>Reflexes </strong>check or be pushed back 1 space and fall <strong>Prone</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the number of spaces pushed by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p>",
